      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The wealthy send lists down from the terraces. Warriors stop on their way home. Workers buy what a shift leaves them enough to afford. Same counter, very different baskets.",
